# Copy to .env (or .env.<mode>, picked with --env <mode>) and fill in what you use. waygraph loads them before the
# config: .env, .env.local, .env.<mode>, .env.<mode>.local, each over the one before; a variable set in the shell wins.
# .env files stay out of git (.gitignore); this one is the list of what the project reads.

# Where the app under test lives (config/waygraph.config.ts). Unset, the scaffold's own demo pages are used.
# BASE_URL=http://localhost:3000

# The mail catcher the email flows read (src/map/(external)/mailpit/). Default http://127.0.0.1:8025.
# WAYGRAPH_MAIL_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8025

# For demo.voice: openAIVoice() in the config (kokoroVoice() needs no key: waygraph extensions install).
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
